    "title": "Symposium on e-bike dangers draws crowd of 200+ to Huntington Beach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hetty Chang ,\n3 hours ago More than 200 people gathered on Wednesday in Huntington Beach for a safety symposium to discuss the dangers of E-bikes and E-motorcycles, especially in the hands of teenage drivers. Parents who lost their children to crashes involving the vehicles spoke at the symposium, as did law enforcement officials who’ve responded... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
